        "text": {
          "content": "<p>The character is on the ground. An attacker who is prone has a -4 penalty on melee attack rolls and cannot use a ranged weapon (except for a crossbow). A defender who is prone gains a +4 bonus to Armor Class against ranged attacks, but takes a -4 penalty to AC against melee attacks.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Standing up is a move-equivalent action that provokes an attack of opportunity.</p>\n<p> </p>",
